        <dc:description>&lt;p class="description"&gt;The Multiverse is a strange and wondrous place filled with stories of all shapes and sizes. Some worlds are similar while others are standalones.   After a villain swaps Will’s body with that of a cat, Will must find the one person who can help him: Dogboy.&lt;/p&gt;

